{title: Its My Desire}
{key: D}

{comment: Verse 1}
[D]It's my desire to live for [A]Jesus
It's my [G]desire, to live for [D]Him;
Though often I've [D]failed Him and caused Him [G]shame
It's my [D]desire to [A]live for [D]Him.

{comment: Chorus}
[D]If you could [G]see, where Jesus brought me from
To where I am to[D]day
Then you would [E]know the reason why I love Him [A]so.
(So) You can [D]take this world all its wealth and riches
[G]I don't need earth's fame
It's my [D]desire to [A]live for [D]Him

{comment: Verse 2}
[D]It's my desire to help someone [A]today
Someone who [G]may have failed to see the [D]way
I, too, was once so [D]lost, but I found my [G]way to God
It's my [D]desire to [A]live for [D]Him.

{comment: Outro}
It's my [D]desire[A]
